  description: "M15B § Player can observe the full water cycle: ground evaporates → cloud forms → rain falls → puddles flow back into low ground → repeat. A steam vent at ground level pumps steam upward; once particles reach altitude > 80 px with ambient temp < 80 C they nucleate into cloud. Cloud saturates over ~30 ticks (Earth humidity 0.55) then waits 60 ticks before precipitation_started fires. Rain droplets fall, land on the basin floor as water via cf-terrain liquid_flow, pool in low ground, and the cycle restarts as the water re-evaporates from solar heating.",
